OL,3,GNEWSACattle grazing on protected
OL,4,Aheathland proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCattle could be introduced to graze on
OL,7,Fa stretch of protected heathland.
OL,9,FDurham County Council is considering
OL,10,Fintroducing farm animals to Waldridge
OL,11,FFell near Chester-le-Street, designated
OL,12,Fas a Site of Special Scientific
OL,13,FInterest by Natural England.
OL,15,FThe local authority said the plans
OL,16,Fcould "help improve biodiversity and
OL,17,Fsupport its future management".
OL,19,FAn online consultation to gather the
OL,20,Fviews of residents will run until 26
OL,21,FOctober.
